  "intro": "Morning report, Wed Nov 18. Quiet delta since the 8:07 AM ET test sweep: no new SafeTrade listings (48 base tickers, unchanged), no new AI or quantum names on CoinGecko's new-listings page, and nothing new cleared the filter. Quantus (80) remains the only strong candidate; 7 WATCH.",
  "snapshots": "Snapshots, not real-time: SafeTrade tickers, CoinGecko new listings and X pulled 8:17-8:22 AM ET Nov 18; prices refresh hourly from CoinGecko.",
  "disclaimer": "Research only, not financial advice. Never connect a wallet, sign or share keys. Small caps and thin books can move fast and go to zero.",
  "takeaways": [
   "Quantus (80) is the only strong candidate: ML-DSA since genesis, mainnet since Sep 9, now on Bitrue (Nov 9) and Raydium (Nov 12) on top of NEAR routes. It is down 26% over 7 days.",
   "Pearl is the biggest SafeTrade name by far ($4.7M SafeTrade volume, about $688M market cap) after Kraken on Nov 13. Watch the PRL/PEARL ticker look-alikes.",
   "Quip Network is the best-documented pre-launch quantum project (named team, published tokenomics, Oak audit) but has no TGE date, so it is capped at 74.",
   "Soqucoin shipped its ML-DSA-44 wallet on Nov 17; miners on SOQUPOOL must move to LuxxPool by Nov 19 at 11 AM ET.",
   "AI presales are noisy this week. Whale Signals, ConConAI, JuvrixAI and STARS AI were rejected for return promises, guaranteed listings or no product."
  ],
